ow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Power of Visuals:</strong> skilfully crafted characters brought to life with beautiful artistry. Experience the characters in new outfits, hairstyles and scenarios!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Unforgettable Voice Cast: featuring a cast of famed voices such as Yui Kondo, KENN, Yoshimasa Hosoya, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra Episodes:</strong> collect memorabilia and extra episodes through certain conditions, and unlock a special episode upon purchase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026310/extras/d2f445006adb9b516fe7bb79e8c7d9f8.avif?t=1753631998\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
